1
00:00:00,101 --> 00:00:01,600
Besok paginya...

2
00:00:01,659 --> 00:00:03,660
chat dari klien akhirnya masuk.

3
00:00:04,147 --> 00:00:06,250
Gue buka pelan-pelan...

4
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:07,720
Desainnya udah pas.

5
00:00:07,784 --> 00:00:08,580
Terima kasih!

6
00:00:08,766 --> 00:00:09,140
HAH?!

7
00:00:09,301 --> 00:00:10,100
DITERIMA?!

8
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,920
ALHAMDULILLAH! AKHIRNYAAA!

9
00:00:13,085 --> 00:00:14,730
Padahal cuma satu poster...

10
00:00:14,825 --> 00:00:16,590
dramanya sampai tujuh episode!

11
00:00:16,747 --> 00:00:18,050
Brief-nya bikin bingung.

12
00:00:18,106 --> 00:00:19,270
Pinterest kebanyakan.

13
00:00:19,319 --> 00:00:20,480
Warna berantakan.

14
00:00:20,513 --> 00:00:22,240
Font malah jadi
undangan nikahan!

15
00:00:22,332 --> 00:00:24,130
Belum lagi revisi kurang nendang...

16
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:26,540
sampai aplikasi nge-freeze
pas deadline!

17
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,550
Lengkap banget penderitaannya.

18
00:00:28,855 --> 00:00:30,000
Tapi dari semua itu,

19
00:00:30,076 --> 00:00:31,820
gue belajar sesuatu.

20
00:00:32,026 --> 00:00:33,630
Sebelum bikin desain yang keren,

21
00:00:33,698 --> 00:00:36,300
gue harus paham masalah
yang mau diselesaikan.

22
00:00:36,479 --> 00:00:37,710
Siapa audiensnya?

23
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,200
Apa pesan utamanya?

24
00:00:39,364 --> 00:00:41,600
Dan apa yang harus
mereka lihat duluan?

25
00:00:41,759 --> 00:00:45,780
Warna, font, dan layout harus bantu
menyampaikan pesan itu.

26
00:00:45,936 --> 00:00:48,260
Bahkan revisi pun
bisa jadi pelajaran,

27
00:00:48,356 --> 00:00:49,580
kalau gue mau dengerin.

28
00:00:49,687 --> 00:00:50,640
Akhirnya...

29
00:00:50,688 --> 00:00:51,940
proyek ini kelar.

30
00:00:52,104 --> 00:00:53,030
Satu poster.

31
00:00:53,135 --> 00:00:54,400
Banyak pelajaran.

32
00:00:54,513 --> 00:00:57,080
Tapi perjalanan desainer ini
belum selesai!

33
00:00:57,211 --> 00:00:58,720
Season dua enaknya bahas apa?

34
00:00:58,817 --> 00:00:59,640
Harga jasa,

35
00:00:59,731 --> 00:01:00,550
portofolio,

36
00:01:00,599 --> 00:01:02,070
atau cari klien pertama?

37
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:03,600
Tulis pilihan lo di komentar!

38
00:01:03,697 --> 00:01:05,350
Sampai ketemu di season dua!
